Package: cttiR
Title: CTTIR Project Builder
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "58561665+r-heller@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates deterministic research project scaffolds from a name,
    research type and goal. Validates declarative configuration, records file
    ownership and browses a bundled catalog of research package candidates.
    This development version provides an offline foundation; workflow adapters
    and catalog lifecycle operations are under development.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: DBI, RSQLite, digest, jsonlite, jsonvalidate, uuid, yaml
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/cttiR
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/cttiR/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
